                        <field name="dc_description">With a hat press the hat studs (felt blanks) are pressed into the desired shape by heat and steam. The hat is then decorated with ribbons, artificial flowers or feathers. In manual hat production, the pumps are also heated by steam, as opposed to industrial production, but manually pulled over a hat shape.<br/>
